From: Active ESL Android CI <engineering@active-esl.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] waydroid: disable multiple desktops backend for bp4a

The host compositor owns desktop layout in Waydroid. With the Android 16
multiple-desktops backend enabled, SystemUI tries to create a freeform desk
root task on a fullscreen-only display and crashes. Disable the read-only
release flag for every bp4a product, including the AESL i.MX8 and i.MX9
targets, while retaining the pinned upstream source lock.

---
 .../enable_multiple_desktops_backend_flag_values.textproto           | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/aconfig/bp4a/com.android.window.flags/enable_multiple_desktops_backend_flag_values.textproto b/aconfig/bp4a/com.android.window.flags/enable_multiple_desktops_backend_flag_values.textproto
index 4e22662384e7..000000000000 100644
--- a/aconfig/bp4a/com.android.window.flags/enable_multiple_desktops_backend_flag_values.textproto
+++ b/aconfig/bp4a/com.android.window.flags/enable_multiple_desktops_backend_flag_values.textproto
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 flag_value {
   package: "com.android.window.flags"
   name: "enable_multiple_desktops_backend"
-  state: ENABLED
+  state: DISABLED
   permission: READ_ONLY
 }
-- 
2.43.0
